                                                "text": "Sorry, I was in the toilet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13e5c484-111a-4f89-b557-819e2d61db88",
                                                "sense_id": "31ccea3c-e70e-359d-8a9a-d72be49b81ae",
                                                "text": "He would hit her when she cried and, if this did not work, would lock her in the toilet for hours on end."
                                            },
